# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo; Windows checkouts (incl. CI runners with
# core.autocrlf=true) were silently converting embedded-resource/source files to CRLF, which broke
# a test that assumed LF-only line endings (see HtmlDiagramGeneratorTests). Pinning this avoids
# platform-dependent behavior going forward instead of just patching around one symptom of it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sln text eol=crlf
